{"id": "65252", "title": "第二次爱", "author": "木瑭", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 9, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/65/65252.htm", "intro": "属性分类：现代／都市生活／未定／正剧\r\n\r\n我听说，有一种人，\r\n\r\n把爱和恨的全部力气送给第一次爱的人，\r\n\r\n而后对身边人，再也没有了热情，被动而麻木。\r\n\r\n最后，他会找一个可能上辈子有仇的人，\r\n\r\n跟他一起度过如此的一段人生。\r\n\r\n我本以为，我会是这个和他上辈子有仇的人，\r\n\r\n可惜，我连这个资格，都没有。", "base": "files/article/html/65/65252", "chapters": [{"title": "1-8", "file": "9713236.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9-17", "file": "9713238.html", "available": false}, {"title": "18-27", "file": "9713239.html", "available": false}, {"title": "28-37", "file": "9713242.html", "available": false}, {"title": "38-47", "file": "9713244.html", "available": false}, {"title": "48-57", "file": "9713247.html", "available": false}, {"title": "58-65", "file": "9713249.html", "available": false}, {"title": "66-73", "file": "9713253.html", "available": false}, {"title": "74-75完结+番外", "file": "9713255.html", "available": false}]}